              <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0">
                <div class="pt-3 border-t border-outline-variant/15 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                  Across the United States, renters insurance costs between $15 and $22 per month on average (or roughly $180 per year). Exact premiums depend on your state's base rate, selected personal property coverage, liability limits, and claim deductible.
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-md">
              <summary class="p-5 flex justify-between items-center font-headline-sm font-bold text-primary hover:text-secondary cursor-pointer list-none select-none gap-4 text-base">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">help_outline</span>
                  </div>
                  <span>How accurate is this renters insurance cost calculator?</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-surface-container-low flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 text-on-surface-variant">
