                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">expand_more</span>
                </div>
              </summary>
              <div class="px-5 pb-5 pt-0">
                <div class="pt-3 border-t border-outline-variant/15 text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                  Most tenants select $20,000 to $30,000 in personal property coverage. This limit should reflect the actual replacement value of your electronics, furniture, clothing, appliances, and personal belongings.
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-sm overflow-hidden transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-md">
              <summary class="p-5 flex justify-between items-center font-headline-sm font-bold text-primary hover:text-secondary cursor-pointer list-none select-none gap-4 text-base">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
